ing bank information, shipping address, and the total amount.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/5d04903da870750a01127a7674d93e3c/apple-pay-sheet%402x.png","line":21,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of a MacBook Pro on the left and an iPhone on the right. The MacBook Pro displays a Safari window that shows an online store with Apple Pay buttons for checking out and adding to a bag. The iPhone displays an Apple Pay payment sheet.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/dd757533a7c6981c4932724381e10ad2/apple-pay-hero%402x.png","line":25,"embedded":true},{"title":"Offering Apple Pay","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/apple-pay#Offering-Apple-Pay","line":27},{"title":"`canMakePayments`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/ApplePayontheWeb/ApplePaySession/canMakePayments","line":29},{"title":"`PKPaymentAuthorizationController`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/PassKit/PKPaymentAuthorizationController","line":29},{"title":"Checking for Apple Pay availability","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/ApplePayontheWeb/checking-for-apple-pay-availability","line":31},{"title":"Offering Apple Pay in Your App","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/PassKit/offering-apple-pay-in-your-app","line":31},{"title":"An illustration that shows the correct arrangement of the Apple Pay logo above a custom button titled 'Order Now'.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/b19a9822ebe73af2ed72bfbdd28ea560/custom-button-yes%402x.png","line":39,"embedded":true},{"title":"Correct usage","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/88662da92338267bb64cd2275c84e484/checkmark%402x.png","line":41,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration that shows the incorrect arrangement of the Apple Pay logo above a custom button titled 'Apple Pay'.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/5e2e1ab926f9963755c0547a3621b125/custom-button-no%402x.png","line":43,"embedded":true},{"title":"Incorrect usage","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/209f6f0fc8ad99d9bf59e12d82d06584/crossout%402x.png","line":45,"embedded":true},{"title":"Apple Pay on the Web","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/ApplePayontheWeb","line":55},{"title":"Apple Pay","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/PassKit/apple-pay","line":55},{"title":"Streamlining checkout","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/apple-pay#Streamlining-checkout","line":57},{"title":"Displaying a Read-Only Pickup Address","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/PassKit/displaying-a-read-only-pickup-address","line":73},{"title":"An illustration of an order confirmation screen on iPhone. The screen contains a button for creating an account and a button for signing up with Apple Pay.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/0c5bcc6893b93e48a9d28c2c91dadb3b/payment-sheet-before-account%402x.png","line":79,"embedded":true},{"title":"Customizing the payment sheet","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/apple-pay#Customizing-the-payment-sheet","line":85},{"title":"`PKDateComponentsRange`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/PassKit/PKDateComponentsRange","line":91},{"title":"Supporting donations","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/apple-pay#Supporting-donations","line":95},{"title":"`paymentSummaryItems`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/PassKit/PKPaymentRequest/paymentSummaryItems","line":95},{"title":"A screenshot of an in-app payment sheet that includes an additional charge for gift wrap and a credit applied for a coupon.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/b3d9d7f7a3968b37723a73f7332a3ec8/payment-sheet-ios%402x.png","line":102,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of a webpage payment sheet that includes an additional charge for gift wrap and a credit applied for a coupon.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/ff1b8604f18eb85fb8b6cf4662399b5b/payment-sheet-web%402x.png","line":104,"embedded":true},{"title":"Data validation","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/apple-pay#Data-validation","line":114},{"title":"Displaying a website icon","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/apple-pay#Displaying-a-website-icon","line":116},{"title":"An illustration of an Apple Pay payment sheet on iPhone, which shows a website icon above the payment details.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/69ae379313b720a151bf5eda6edc712f/web-icon-payment%402x.png","line":126,"embedded":true},{"title":"Handling errors","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/apple-pay#Handling-errors","line":128},{"title":"Data validation","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/apple-pay#Data-validation","line":132},{"title":"A screenshot of an in-app Apple Pay payment sheet on iPhone that shows an error with the shipping address.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/057eb557e82a7dc0d59ff9d65470088d/pay-sheet-error-ios%402x.png","line":141,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of an in-app shipping screen on iPhone. The screen denotes the zip code doesn't match the city for the home address. Options exist to select or add a different shipping address.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/6a42ac3ec83ff9f41a1f370368626d6a/detail-view-error-ios%402x.png","line":145,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of a webpage Apple Pay payment sheet that shows an error with the shipping address.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/0c3c7e0628e9de82ef6d42745b1f248c/pay-sheet-error-web%402x.png","line":149,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of a webpage Apple Pay payment sheet that shows an error with the shipping address. An overlay appears over the payment sheet and denotes the zip code doesn't match the city for the home address. Options exist to select a different shipping address or edit the shipping address.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/a45156f5412182c743a9c448effb3ba2/detail-view-error-web%402x.png","line":151,"embedded":true},{"title":"Apple Pay on the Web","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/ApplePayontheWeb","line":155},{"title":"`PKPaymentAuthorizationViewControllerDelegate`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/PassKit/PKPaymentAuthorizationViewControllerDelegate","line":155},{"title":"Apple Pay Status Codes","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/ApplePayontheWeb/apple-pay-status-codes","line":163},{"title":"`PKPaymentError`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/PassKit/PKPaymentError","line":163},{"title":"Payment processing","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/apple-pay#Payment-processing","line":167},{"title":"`oncancel`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/ApplePayontheWeb/ApplePaySession/oncancel","line":169},{"title":"`PKPaymentAuthorizationViewControllerDelegate`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/PassKit/PKPaymentAuthorizationViewControllerDelegate","line":169},{"title":"Supporting subscriptions","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/apple-pay#Supporting-subscriptions","line":171},{"title":"A screenshot of an in-app Apple Pay payment sheet for a fixed subscription, which includes a monthly amount.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/598121af8dc2f5d00ce80d355d6d2729/fixed-subscription-ios%402x.png","line":180,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of an in-app Apple Pay payment sheet for a variable subscription, which includes the text 'Amount Pending'.","target":"https://docs